Here's the test.

6
00:00:11,696 --> 00:00:14,010
Sixty-eight transactions from October.

7
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,006
Three questions:

8
00:00:15,056 --> 00:00:17,308
how much did I spend on groceries, is

9
00:00:17,358 --> 00:00:19,797
there a duplicate charge, and what do my

10
