15
00:00:26,582 --> 00:00:27,851
All three caught it.

16
00:00:27,901 --> 00:00:32,466
Luna Trattoria, fifty-six forty, charged twice on October seventeenth.

17
00:00:32,516 --> 00:00:33,850
A point for everyone.

18
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:34,761
Round two:

19
00:00:34,811 --> 00:00:35,616
subscriptions.

20
