46
00:01:30,307 --> 00:01:32,021
ChatGPT, two out of three.

47
00:01:32,071 --> 00:01:34,668
Claude made its own call on what counts

48
00:01:34,718 --> 00:01:35,550
as groceries.

49
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:38,484
So when money is involved, do two things:

50
00:01:38,534 --> 00:01:40,925
